    "updated_at": "2025-11-27T09:38:37Z",
    "body": "Thanks. The difference between forwarding it and the way you've described Blink/WebKit doing it, is that the template-contents document won't update its flag after it's set on construction, whereas if it's passed in it could potentially change over time. I don't know if that actually happens in practice though.",
